  "architecture": {
    "hexagonal": "Trusted native main/editor/viewer \u2192 design_viewer_begin \u2192 M03 facade \u2192 M04 sole owner snapshot input port; C1 validated read projection provider \u2192 detached Preview \u2192 same native consumer",
