  },
  "premises": [
    "Native caller/local origin and instance nonce supplied by trusted host, never request fields. Model trusted_local is a premise, not authentication proof.",
    "M04 provider supplies one immutable snapshot from its unique owner, C1 provider supplies already validated projection. Model does not implement C1, graph validation, material verification or rendering.",
    "Provider result is not trusted across changed instance/document/generation/revision. Late delivery must revalidate before publication.",
    "Missing material/binding uses inert placeholder and disabled capability upstream; begin does not fetch bytes or invent IO. Exact material provider integration deferred."
  ],
